WEBVTT

00:00:02.581 --> 00:00:06.671
Behind the Classes door, the Class Library now lists every class.

00:00:10.324 --> 00:00:15.307
It opens with Classes, and the promise: ride a video alone, or join a group. The

00:00:15.307 --> 00:00:17.102
bike follows either way.

00:00:20.647 --> 00:00:25.324
Three shelves, by length: twenty minutes, thirty, and sixty for endurance, each with

00:00:25.324 --> 00:00:26.292
its tagline.

00:00:30.971 --> 00:00:36.119
Each open card shows its cover, its length, a resistance profile drawn from its

00:00:36.119 --> 00:00:38.961
plan, its title, its channel and focus.

00:00:41.295 --> 00:00:44.440
An open card leads to that class's Class Start.

00:00:51.618 --> 00:00:56.353
The Class length tabs show one shelf, or all of them. The arrow keys move between

00:00:56.353 --> 00:00:58.290
tabs, from the keyboard too.

00:01:01.942 --> 00:01:06.893
A new rider starts at level one. A class above that is locked, and says the level

00:01:06.893 --> 00:01:08.049
that opens it.

00:01:12.266 --> 00:01:16.990
A locked card stays in the tab order, so a screen reader announces the level, and it

00:01:16.990 --> 00:01:18.077
leads nowhere.

00:01:22.590 --> 00:01:27.793
With no catalogue to read and none kept on the device, the library says so, and Try

00:01:27.793 --> 00:01:29.159
again asks again.

00:01:32.913 --> 00:01:37.208
The same library, from one column on a phone to three on a desktop.

00:01:43.237 --> 00:01:47.591
What the tests prove: five behaviour specs through the page, all green, and the

00:01:47.591 --> 00:01:49.654
first bundle still under budget.

00:01:53.561 --> 00:01:58.164
Telo Ride, from the Telo family, turns a smart bike at home into a game.

00:01:58.509 --> 00:02:03.021
It pairs with the bike over Bluetooth, reads your power and sets resistance for

00:02:03.021 --> 00:02:04.692
every hill and interval.

00:02:05.037 --> 00:02:10.215
Two doors: Race (ride a map against your best-time ghost, bots or people) and

00:02:10.215 --> 00:02:15.663
Classes (ride along to a video, alone or with a group), fed by one progression of

00:02:15.663 --> 00:02:18.653
XP, rider levels, stars and map unlocks.

00:02:18.998 --> 00:02:21.491
A custom workout lives under Profile.
